    {
      "id": "much-ado-about-nothing/sceneI_25.2/p@21547",
      "type": "stage",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "scenedesc"
      ],
      "text": "Enter Leonato and Antonio, meeting.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [
        {
          "tag": "span",
          "start": 6,
          "end": 13,
          "className": "charname"
        },
        {
          "tag": "span",
          "start": 18,
          "end": 25,
          "className": "charname"
        }
      ],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "much-ado-about-nothing/sceneI_25.2/p@21547/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 35,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 4376628,
        "end": 4376752,
        "line": 161921,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap25/p@21547",
        "anchor": "sceneI_25.2"
      },
      "speakerLabel": null,
      "attribution": {
        "status": "not-applicable"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "much-ado-about-nothing/sceneI_25.2/p@21675",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "LEONATO.\nHow now, brother? Where is my cousin your son? Hath he provided this music?",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "much-ado-about-nothing/sceneI_25.2/p@21675/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 8,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "much-ado-about-nothing/sceneI_25.2/p@21675/line-2",
          "start": 9,
          "end": 84,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 4376756,
        "end": 4376870,
        "line": 161925,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap25/p@21675",
        "anchor": "sceneI_25.2"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "LEONATO.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 8
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "much-ado-about-nothing/sceneI_25.2/p@21793",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "ANTONIO.\nHe is very busy about it. But, brother, I can tell you strange news that you yet dreamt not of.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "much-ado-about-nothing/sceneI_25.2/p@21793/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 8,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "much-ado-about-nothing/sceneI_25.2/p@21793/line-2",
          "start": 9,
          "end": 104,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 4376874,
        "end": 4377009,
        "line": 161930,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap25/p@21793",
        "anchor": "sceneI_25.2"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "ANTONIO.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 8
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "much-ado-about-nothing/sceneI_25.2/p@21932",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "LEONATO.\nAre they good?",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "much-ado-about-nothing/sceneI_25.2/p@21932/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 8,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "much-ado-about-nothing/sceneI_25.2/p@21932/line-2",
          "start": 9,
          "end": 23,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 4377013,
        "end": 4377066,
        "line": 161936,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap25/p@21932",
        "anchor": "sceneI_25.2"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "LEONATO.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 8
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "much-ado-about-nothing/sceneI_25.2/p@21989",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "ANTONIO.\nAs the event stamps them: but they have a good cover; they show well outward. The Prince and Count Claudio, walking in a thick-pleached alley in my orchard, were thus much overheard by a man of mine: the Prince discovered to Claudio that he loved my niece your daughter and meant to acknowledge it this night in a dance; and if he found her accordant, he meant to take the present time by the top and instantly break with you of it.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "much-ado-about-nothing/sceneI_25.2/p@21989/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 8,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "much-ado-about-nothing/sceneI_25.2/p@21989/line-2",
          "start": 9,
          "end": 441,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 4377070,
        "end": 4377546,
        "line": 161941,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap25/p@21989",
        "anchor": "sceneI_25.2"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "ANTONIO.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 8
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "much-ado-about-nothing/sceneI_25.2/p@22469",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "LEONATO.\nHath the fellow any wit that told you this?",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "much-ado-about-nothing/sceneI_25.2/p@22469/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 8,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "much-ado-about-nothing/sceneI_25.2/p@22469/line-2",
          "start": 9,
          "end": 52,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 4377550,
        "end": 4377631,
        "line": 161951,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap25/p@22469",
        "anchor": "sceneI_25.2"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "LEONATO.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 8
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "much-ado-about-nothing/sceneI_25.2/p@22554",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "ANTONIO.\nA good sharp fellow: I will send for him; and question him yourself.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "much-ado-about-nothing/sceneI_25.2/p@22554/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 8,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "much-ado-about-nothing/sceneI_25.2/p@22554/line-2",
          "start": 9,
          "end": 77,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 4377635,
        "end": 4377742,
        "line": 161955,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap25/p@22554",
        "anchor": "sceneI_25.2"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "ANTONIO.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 8
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "much-ado-about-nothing/sceneI_25.2/p@22665",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "LEONATO.\nNo, no; we will hold it as a dream till it appear itself: but I will acquaint my daughter withal, that she may be the better prepared for an answer, if peradventure this be true. Go you and tell her of it.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "much-ado-about-nothing/sceneI_25.2/p@22665/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 8,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "much-ado-about-nothing/sceneI_25.2/p@22665/line-2",
          "start": 9,
          "end": 214,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 4377746,
        "end": 4377992,
        "line": 161960,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap25/p@22665",
        "anchor": "sceneI_25.2"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "LEONATO.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 8
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "much-ado-about-nothing/sceneI_25.2/p@22915",
      "type": "passage",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "right"
      ],
      "text": "[Several persons cross the stage.]",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [
        {
          "tag": "i",
          "start": 1,
          "end": 33
        }
      ],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "much-ado-about-nothing/sceneI_25.2/p@22915/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 34,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 4377996,
        "end": 4378062,
        "line": 161967,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap25/p@22915",
        "anchor": "sceneI_25.2"
      },
      "speakerLabel": null,
      "attribution": {
        "status": "source-unlabelled"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "much-ado-about-nothing/sceneI_25.2/p@22985",
      "type": "passage",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "Cousins, you know what you have to do. O! I cry you mercy, friend; go you with me, and I will use your skill. Good cousin, have a care this busy time.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "much-ado-about-nothing/sceneI_25.2/p@22985/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 150,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 4378066,
        "end": 4378242,
        "line": 161971,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap25/p@22985",
        "anchor": "sceneI_25.2"
      },
      "speakerLabel": null,
      "attribution": {
        "status": "source-unlabelled"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "much-ado-about-nothing/sceneI_25.2/p@23165",
      "type": "passage",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "right"
      ],
      "text": "[Exeunt.]",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [
        {
          "tag": "i",
          "start": 1,
          "end": 8
        }
      ],
      "lines": [
